            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.208,
            0.848,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Find a partner to play this game with. In 10 seconds, the person who writes a number or an expression, using only the digits 0 - 9 and arithmetic operations, that gives a number that is the larger between the two wins the round."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.219,
            0.286,
            0.426,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10000000000000"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.609,
            0.287,
            0.818,
            0.308
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "999999×999999"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.318,
            0.847,
            0.373
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In Round 1, Roxie wrote 10000000000000 and Estu wrote 999999 × 999999. Between these two, Roxie’s number is greater. Can you see why? Roxie’s number is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 0 ^ { 1 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , whereas Estu’s number is less than "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left( 1 0 ^ { 6 } \\right) ^ { 2 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.373,
            0.846,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In Round 2, Roxie wrote "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 0 } + 1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 0 } + 1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 0 } + 1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 0 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and Estu wrote "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( 1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 0 0 0 } ) \\times 9 0 \\dot { 0 } 0"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Can you say which is greater?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.423,
            0.438,
            0.455
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_28_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 ^ { 3 } } + 1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 0 } + 1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 0 } + 1 0 ^ { 1 0 0 0 }"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.689,
            0.424,
            0.845,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "100 0 000 10 ×9000"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.465,
            0.842,
            0.484
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Below are some conditions that you may consider for different rounds."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.485,
            0.749,
            0.503
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Exponents are not allowed. Only addition is allowed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.502,
            0.846,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Exponents are not allowed. Only addition and multiplication are allowed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.539,
            0.711,
            0.558
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) Exponents are allowed. Only addition is allowed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.558,
            0.846,
            0.615
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) Exponents are allowed. Any arithmetic operation is allowed. You can create your own conditions and/or involve more people to play together."
            }
          ]
        },
